  m_Name: Fuel_Injector12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Fuel Injector 12
  description: Fuel Injector 12 is one of the multiple fuel injectors in the engine,
    tasked with delivering a precise amount of fuel to the combustion chamber. Its
    role is vital for maintaining the correct air-fuel mixture, which directly impacts
    engine power output and efficiency. An interesting aspect of Fuel Injector 12
    is its ability to withstand the high pressures and temperatures present in the
    combustion chamber.
